OL,3,GNEWSAFurther delay to reopening of
OL,4,Abridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe reopening of a bridge in Beverley
OL,7,Fis to be delayed by a further few
OL,8,Fweeks.
OL,10,FThe 72-year-old Weel Bridge was removed
OL,11,Fin April and transported to Sheffield
OL,12,Ffor specialist refurbishment by
OL,13,Fcontractor Esh Construction.
OL,15,FHowever, as work progressed, engineers
OL,16,Funcovered hidden defects resulting in
OL,17,Fthe opening being pushed back from July
OL,18,Fto August. That has now been further
OL,19,Fdelayed, according to the Local
OL,20,FDemocracy Reporting Service, due to the
OL,21,Fcontractor experiencing supply chain
OL,22,Fissues.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
