OL,3,GNEWSAFurther delay to reopening of
OL,4,Abridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for East Riding of
OL,7,FYorkshire Council said the bridge would
OL,8,Freturn in the next couple of weeks and
OL,9,Fit would then take a couple of weeks
OL,10,Fbefore it could reopen to the public.
